//bucket.mustard.blog/accounts/avatars/109/320/774/428/629/867/original/79b66bb39b7c792b.png",followers:169,bot:!1,lang:"ko",id:"109320774428629867"},{acct:"kosmo@planet.moe",displayName:"\uCF54\uC2A4\uBAA8",note:'<p>\uB3D9\uC778 \uCC3D\uC791 \uBB38\uD654 \uD5A5\uC720\uC790\uB97C \uC704\uD55C \uCC28\uC138\uB300 SNS</p><p>\uC6B0\uB2F9\uD0D5\uD0D5 \uAC1C\uBC1C\uC77C\uC9C0 <span class="h-card" translate="no"><a href="https://planet.moe/@byulmaru_team" class="u-url mention">@<span>byulmaru_team</span></a></span></p>',url:"https://planet.moe/@kosmo",avatar:"https://media.planet.moe/accounts/avatars/116/797/811/577/421/755/original/65296cfd98a2b64c.png",followers:65,bot:!1,lang:"ko",id:"116797811577421755"},{acct:"m@town.voyager.blue",displayName:"\uBCF4\uC774\uC800 \uCEF4\uD328\uB2C8\uC5B8 \uC911\uC7AC\uACFC",note:"<p>\u300A\uD398\uC77C \uBE14\uB8E8 \uBCF4\uC774\uC800 \uB124\uD2B8\uC6CC\uD06C\u300B \uC6B4\uC601 \uC870\uC9C1 \u300A\uBCF4\uC774\uC800 \uCEF4\uD328\uB2C8\uC5B8\u300B \uC911\uC7AC\uACFC \uACC4\uC815</p><p>- \uC11C\uBC84 \uADDC\uCE59 \uB610\uB294 \uC138\uBD80 \uB0B4\uC6A9 \uB4F1\uC758 \uAC1C\uC815, \uC911\uC7AC\uC640 \uAD00\uB828\uB41C \uACF5\uAC1C \uACF5\uC9C0 \uB0B4\uC6A9\uC774 \uACF5\uAC1C \uAE00\uB85C \uAC8C\uC2DC\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4.<br />- \uC911\uC7AC \uB0B4\uC6A9\uC740 \uC804\uC790 \uBA54\uC77C\uC744 \uD1B5\uD574 \uACE0\uC9C0\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC678\uBD80 \uC11C\uBC84 \uB610\uB294 \uC0AC\uC6A9\uC790\uC5D0 \uB300\uD55C \uC911\uC7AC \uB0B4\uC6A9\uC740 \uD574\uB2F9 \uC11C\uBC84\uC758 \uC5F0\uB77D\uCC98 \uC804\uC790 \uBA54\uC77C \uC8FC\uC18C\uB85C \uBC1C\uC1A1\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4.<br />- \uC911\uC7AC\uC5D0 \uB300\uD55C \uBB38\uC758\uB294 \uC544\uB798\uC758 \uC5F0\uB77D\uC744 \uC704\uD55C \uC804\uC790 \uBA54\uC77C \uC8FC\uC18C\uB85C \uC5F0\uB77D\uC744 \uBD80\uD0C1\uB4DC\uB9BD\uB2C8\uB2E4. DM\uC73C\uB85C \uC5F0\uB77D\uC744 \uD558\uB294 \uACBD\uC6B0 \uB0B4\uC6A9\uC774 \uC554\uD638\uD654\uB418\uC9C0 \uC54A\uC544 \uAC1C\uC778 \uC815\uBCF4 \uC720\uCD9C\uC758 \uC704\uD5D8\uC774 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.<br />- \uC911\uC7AC\uD300\uC740 \uD56D\uC0C1 \uB300\uAE30\uD558\uACE0 \uC788\uC9C0 \uC54A\uC73C\uBA70 \uBE60\uB978 \uC2DC\uAC04 \uB0B4\uC5D0 \uD68C\uC2E0\uC744 \uB4DC\uB9B4 \uC218 \uC5C6\uB2E4\uB294 \uC810\uC744 \uC591\uD574 \uBD80\uD0C1\uB4DC\uB9BD\uB2C8\uB2E4. 24\uC2DC\uAC04 \uB0B4\uC5D0 \uD68C\uC2E0\uC744 \uBC1B\uC9C0 \uBABB\uD558\uC600\uC744 \uACBD\uC6B0 \uBC88\uAC70\uB86D\uB354\uB77C\uB3C4 \uB2E4\uC2DC \uC5F0\uB77D\uC744 \uBD80\uD0C1\uB4DC\uB9BD\uB2C8\uB2E4.<br />- \uC774 \uACC4\uC815\uC744 \uCC28\uB2E8\uD558\uB294 \uB4F1 \uC911\uC7AC\uB97C \uD68C\uD53C\xB7\uAC70\uBD80\uD558\uB294 \uC0AC\uC6A9\uC790\uB098 \uC11C\uBC84\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574\uC11C\uB294 \uC804\uC801\uC73C\uB85C \uC2E0\uACE0\uC790\uC758 \uC758\uACAC \uB610\uB294 \uADDC\uCE59\uC758 \uC138\uBD80 \uB0B4\uC6A9\uC5D0 \uC815\uD574\uC9C4 \uCD5C\uB300 \uC870\uCE58\uAC00 \uC911\uC7AC\uC5D0 \uC801\uC6A9\uB418\uBA70, \uD5A5\uD6C4 \uC774\uC758\uB97C \uC81C\uAE30\uD560 \uB54C \uBD88\uC774\uC775\uC744 \uBC1B\uC744 \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.<br />- \uC911\uC7AC\uD300 \uAD6C\uC131\uC6D0\uC758 \uC2E0\uC0C1 \uC815\uBCF4\uB294 \uACF5\uAC1C\uB418\uC9C0 \uC54A\uC73C\uBA70, \uC774\uB97C \uCD94\uC801\uD558\uB824\uB294 \uD589\uC704\uB294 \uADDC\uCE59\uC5D0 \uC704\uBC30\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4.</p>",url:"https://town.voyager.blue/@M",avatar:"https://hanger3.voyager.blue/accounts/avatars/112/195/709/999/862/788/original/12bb9c64e8544c0a.png",followers:14,bot:!1,lang:"ko",id:"112195709999862788"}]},{slug:"film-and-tv",lang:"de",title:{en:"Film and TV",de:"Film und Fernsehen",fr:"Cin\xE9ma et t\xE9l\xE9vision",es:"Cine y televisi\xF3n",ja:"\u6620\u753B\u3068\u30C6\u30EC\u30D3",it:"Cinema e TV",pt:"Cinema e TV",nl:"Film en tv",pl:"Film i telewizja",sv:"Film och TV",ru:"\u041A\u0438\u043D\u043E \u0438 \u0442\u0435\u043B\u0435\u0432\u0438\u0434\u0435\u043D\u0438\u0435",ko:"\uC601\uD654\uC640 TV",uk:"\u041A\u0456\u043D\u043E \u0456 \u0442\u0435\u043B\u0435\u0431\u0430\u0447\u0435\u043D\u043D\u044F",tr:"Film ve televizyon",el:"\u039A\u03B9\u03BD\u03B7\u03BC\u03B1\u03C4\u03BF\u03B3\u03C1\u03AC\u03C6\u03BF\u03C2 \u03BA\u03B1\u03B9 \u03C4\u03B7\u03BB\u03B5\u03CC\u03C1\u03B1\u03C3\u03B7",zh:"\u7535\u5F71\u4E0E\u7535\u89C6",ca:"Cinema i televisi\xF3",cs:"Film a televize",fi:"Elokuvat ja televisio",no:"Film og TV",ar:"\u0627\u0644\u0633\u064A\u0646\u0645\u0627 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u062A\u0644\u0641\u0632\u064A\u0648\u0646","zh-Hant":"\u96FB\u5F71\u8207\u96FB\u8996"},blurb:{en:"Critics, filmmakers, and people with opinions about what to watch.",it:"Critici, registi e persone con consigli su cosa guardare.",de:"Kritiker, Filmschaffende und Menschen mit Empfehlungen f\xFCr Film und Fernsehen.",es:"Cr\xEDticos, cineastas y personas con opiniones sobre qu\xE9 ver."},icon:"\u{1F3AC}",accounts:[{acct:"radicalresilience@todon.nl",displayName:"Radical Resilience Film",note:'<p>We are a film and education collective.<br />Last film Radical Resilience about activist burnout : <a href="https://radicalresilience.noblogs.org/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" translate="no"><span class="invisible">https://</span><span class="">radicalresilience.noblogs.org/</span><span class="invisible"></span></a><br />Now working on a film about disability and political activism.<br />We offer workshops on resilience and ableism.<br />We are white, non-binary, disabled and neurodiverse.<br />Toot &amp; boost mainly in English &amp; German.</p>',url:"https://todon.nl/@radicalresilience",avatar:"https://todon.nl/system/accounts/avatars/000/179/939/original/1042293f3a5bda7d.png",followers:799,bot:!1,lang:"de",id:"179939"},{acct:"planlos_in_leipzig@mastodon.social",displayName:"Planlos in Leipzig",note:'<p>Inoffizieller Terminbot von Planlos, dem linksradikalen Kalender von Leipzig und Umgebung <a href="https://www.planlos-leipzig.org" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" translate="no"><span class="invisible">https://www.</span><span class="">planlos-leipzig.org</span><span class="invisible"></span></a></p><p>Ich tr\xF6te jeden Termin, den ich neu gefunden habe, einmal. Au\xDFerdem erinnere ich um 17 Uhr am Vortag des jeweiligen Events an den Termin.</p><p>F\xFCr regelm\xE4\xDFge Events siehe <a href="https://www.planlos-leipzig.org/planlos-kalender/regelmaessige-termine/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" translate="no"><span class="invisible">https://www.</span><span class="ellipsis">planlos-leipzig.org/planlos-ka</span><span class="invisible">lender/regelmaessige-termine/</span></a></p>',url:"https://mastodon.social/@planlos_in_leipzig",avatar:"https://files.mastodon.social/accounts/avatars/113/651/548/448/559/994/original/a4c5049f8ff42d12.png",followers:676,bot:!0,lang:"de",id:"113651548448559994"},{acct:"celeo@norden.social",displayName:"celeo.de :verified:",note:"<p>Mehr oder weniger automatische Tr\xF6ts vom Filmverzeichnis celeo.de zum Thema Spielfilme...</p><p>Um eigene Filmtr\xF6ts zu verschicken, auf celeo.de registrieren und Celeo-Konto mit dem eigenen Mastodon-Konto verkn\xFCpfen!</p>",url:"https://norden.social/@celeo",avatar:"https://media.norden.social/accounts/avatars/108/245/073/837/921/608/original/d52bfe07a80127b1.png",followers:110,bot:!0,lang:"de",id:"108245073837921608"},{acct:"plattenase@mastodon.social",displayName:"platenlaase.de",note:'<p>Kulturplattforum<br />Forum + Plattform f.d. Kulturverein Platenlaase<br /><a href="https://www.platenlaase.de/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" translate="no"><span class="invisible">https://www.</span><span class="">platenlaase.de/</span><span class="invisible"></span></a></p><p>Seit 1982 Kultur schaffend und Kultur schenkend \u2013 hei\xDFt:<br />Musik, Kino, Theater, Caf\xE9 u. Kneipe, mit K\xFCnstlerwohnung.<br />Mitten im Wendland.</p><p>Wir sind demokratisch, also auch politisch aktiv<br />und sch\xFCtzen die Menschenrechte \u2013 alle!</p><p>Mitmacher*-  u.  F\xF6rder*innen werden stets gesucht.</p>',url:"https://mastodon.social/@plattenase",avatar:"https://files.mastodon.social/accounts/avatars/109/500/447/497/077/162/original/5b234364f4598bf2.png",followers:248,bot:!1,lang:"de",id:"109500447497077162"},{acct:"bastionbochum@ruhr.social",displayName:"BASTION Bochum",note:"<p>Off-Kulturzentrum, Cham\xE4leon unter den Veranstaltungsorten, au\xDFergew\xF6hnliche Location f\xFCr Privatpartys &amp; Seminare. Staying underground since 2002.</p>",url:"https://ruhr.social/@BASTIONBochum",avatar:"https://media.ruhr.social/ruhr-social/accounts/avatars/109/518/036/338/818/449/original/fbf2211c5b374672.jpg",followers:222,bot:!1,lang:"de",id:"109518036338818449"},{acct:"ehtron@mastodon.de",displayName:"ehtron :verify:\u{1F5A5}\uFE0F\u200B\u200B\u{1F6B2}:signal:",note:'<p><a href="https://mastodon.de/tags/gr%C3%B6mitz" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag">#<span>gr\xF6mitz</span></a> <a href="https://mastodon.de/tags/groemitz" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag">#<span>groemitz</span></a> <a href="https://mastodon.de/tags/ostsee" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag">#<span>ostsee</span></a> <a href="https://mastodon.de/tags/linuxmint" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag">#<span>linuxmint</span></a> <a href="https://mastodon.de/tags/linux" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag">#<span>linux</span></a> <a href="https://mastodon.de/tags/support" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag">#<span>support</span></a> <a href="https://mastodon.de/tags/ostholstein" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag">#<span>ostholstein</span></a> <a href="https://mastodon.de/tags/schleswigholstein" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag">#<span>schleswigholstein</span></a> <a href="https://mastodon.de/tags/support" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag">#<span>support</span></a> <a href="https://mastodon.de/tags/IT" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag">#<span>IT</span></a> <a href="https://mastodon.de/tags/signal" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag">#<span>signal</span></a> <a href="https://mastodon.de/tags/balkonsolar" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag">#<span>balkonsolar</span></a> <a href="https://masto